## SavedVariables: SpokenReadablesSettings, SpokenBooksSettings
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: SpokenReadablesCharacter, SpokenBooksCharacter
# Two tables, because they answer different questions. SpokenReadablesSettings is how you like the
# addon to behave and is yours; SpokenReadablesCharacter is what a particular character has heard,
# so an alt walking into the same library is read to rather than met with silence.
